{"about_the_game":"Welcome to Tiny Kitchen: Burger Edition, a cozy food-truck game where clicking buttons drops ingredients, and physics takes care of the rest.<br><br>Your job? Build the perfect burger using simple one-click controls. Flip patties, drop buns, and hope the bacon lands just right. Every order is a small challenge \u2014 and a slightly ridiculous mess.<br><br>Play in full screen for fast-paced fun, or minimize and wait for the next order bell in background mode. Whether you\u2019re a multitasker, a casual gamer, or just here for the silly physics, Burger Edition is built to fit your rhythm.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><br>\ud83c\udf54 <strong>Click to cook:</strong> Drop ingredients with one button per item \u2014 no dragging, no timers.<br><br>\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Casual chaos:</strong> Every stack is physics-driven \u2014 delicious, unpredictable fun.<br><br>\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Unlock &amp; upgrade:</strong> Expand your food truck and earn tips from happy (or confused) customers.<br><br>\ud83e\uddd8\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Idle-friendly:</strong> Minimize the game and get notified when a new order arrives.<br><br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Modes to match your day:</strong> Play actively, relax with slow orders, or use Pomodoro mode to gamify your productivity.<br><br>\ud83d\udcbb <strong>Windowed multitasking:</strong> Great for playing alongside work, studying, or streaming.<br><br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Global rankings:</strong> Earn your place among the world\u2019s top burger builders.<br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840240?t=1762867308","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840240/fd148eab413273960dd94432a03cc7dcd16e245b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762867308","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840240/6a830aa70c4a1f6dda6ac47743ded6519a837151/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762867308","capsule_imagev5":